OL,3,AFrance holds new strikes and protests
OL,4,Aas unions demand immediate answers
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtests are taking place across France
OL,7,Fafter five unions launched a national
OL,8,Fday of strike action, joining high
OL,9,Fschool students and demonstrators
OL,10,Fcriticising the rising cost of living.
OL,12,FMore than 250,000 people had taken to
OL,13,Fthe streets in almost 70 towns and
OL,14,Fcities by 13:00 (12:00 GMT) on
OL,15,FThursday, and that was "just the
OL,16,Fstart", said Sophie Binet of the CGT
OL,17,Funion.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
