OL,3,AFrance holds new strikes and protests
OL,4,Aas unions demand immediate answers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe unions have vowed to take the wave
OL,7,Fof protests that began in September
OL,8,Fover poor conditions and resources at
OL,9,Flycees (high schools) "to the next
OL,10,Flevel".
OL,12,FThey have since spread to include
OL,13,Fworkers and the so-called "yellow-vest"
OL,14,Fmovement against high prices.
